cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these artifacts, please cite both the software/data archive and the accompanying article."
title: "Semantic artifacts for: Making geospatial data FAIR for digital health: a semantic interoperability framework"
abstract: >-
  Semantic artifacts accompanying the manuscript. Includes per-source data-preprocessing scripts,
  Ontop OBDA mappings exposing a virtual RDF layer over PostgreSQL/PostGIS, ShEx schemas extracted
  with sheXer, GeoSPARQL conformance tests across SPARQL endpoints, SSSOM mapping sets aligning
  contextual-indicator and geographic-area fields to Wikidata identifiers, and one unified SPARQL query in GraphDB. 
